			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">Emerging growth company <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany" id="c24" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></p>
