<ix:exclude><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">On July 13, 2026, the Company paid a quarterly dividend of $<ix:nonFraction id="c614" contextRef="d_2026-07-13_2026-07-13_SubsequentEventTypeAxis-SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:CommonStockDividendsPerShareCashPaid" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.1525</ix:nonFraction> per common share to all shareholders of record on July 6, 2026. The total amount of the dividend was approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c615" contextRef="d_2026-07-13_2026-07-13_SubsequentEventTypeAxis-SubsequentEventMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:DividendsCommonStockCash" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">2.1</ix:nonFraction> million and was charged against retained earnings.</p>
</ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<div>&#160;</div>

